{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And the days that we walked from Kadesh Barnea.</b> Not walking specifically, but whether standing or walking. <b>That we walked from Kadesh Barnea</b> — the second time, that we came to Kadesh Barnea. <b>Until we crossed et Nahal Zered</b> — and the reason it specifies <b>et Nahal Zered</b> is because it was the first of all the rivers that they crossed."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:22.257358765Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}